    "# SOAL 1\n",
    "## Sistem Persamaan Linear\n",
    "\n",
    "Diketahui sistem persamaan linear:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{aligned}\n",
    "3x_1+2x_2&=-7\\\\\n",
    "-3x_1+5x_2-x_3&=9\\\\\n",
    "6x_1+5x_2+12x_3&=47\n",
    "\\end{aligned}\n",
    "$$\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "63b1d9b8-36f7-4bef-99ee-3824cdb75af9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Matriks Koefisien\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "A=\n",
    "\\begin{bmatrix}\n",
    "3&2&0\\\\\n",
    "-3&5&-1\\\\\n",
    "6&5&12\n",
    "\\end{bmatrix}\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f8246fce-2925-4e72-af01-460cbacd6449",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Vektor Konstanta\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "b=\n",
    "\\begin{bmatrix}\n",
    "-7\\\\9\\\\47\n",
    "\\end{bmatrix}\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2034d02f-034f-49b3-b42f-c481df0c6cd2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Perhitungan Error\n",
    "\n",
    "**L1 Norm**\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "E_1=\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\n",
    "|x_i^{(k+1)}-x_i^{(k)}|\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "**L2 Norm**\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "E_2=\n",
    "\\sqrt{\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\n",
    "(x_i^{(k+1)}-x_i^{(k)})^2}\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "21400e56-a7f7-4cdd-9c95-13599fe03328",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Metode 1: Gauss Elimination\n",
    "\n",
    "**Making an Augmented Matrix**\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "[A|b]=\n",
    "\\left[\n",
    "\\begin{array}{ccc|c}\n",
    "3&2&0&-7\\\\\n",
    "-3&5&-1&9\\\\\n",
    "6&5&12&47\n",
    "\\end{array}\n",
    "\\right]\n",
    "$$\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 29,
   "id": "9bf4cc57-1594-4966-ae34-c4a54dc45019",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "A = \n",
      " [[ 3.  2.  0.]\n",
      " [-3.  5. -1.]\n",
      " [ 6.  5. 12.]]\n",
      "b = \n",
      " [[-7.]\n",
      " [ 9.]\n",
      " [47.]]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "\n",
    "A = np.array([[3, 2, 0],\n",
    "              [-3, 5, -1],\n",
    "              [6, 5, 12]], dtype=float)\n",
    "\n",
    "b = np.array([[-7], [9], [47]], dtype=float)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('A = \\n', A)\n",
    "print('b = \\n', b)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 30,
   "id": "a95599a9-d63c-4453-84d3-e52ca4282be1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Augmented Matrix = \n",
      " [[ 3.  2.  0. -7.]\n",
      " [-3.  5. -1.  9.]\n",
      " [ 6.  5. 12. 47.]]\n",
      "Number of Rows =  3\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "Ab = np.column_stack((A, b))\n",
    "m = len(A)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Augmented Matrix = \\n', Ab)\n",
    "print('Number of Rows = ', m)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "46a60896-7ddf-4468-8eaf-4bfd2c92dc5f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Forward Elimination**\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "R_j\\leftarrow R_j-\\epsilon_{ji}R_i\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\epsilon_{ji}=\\frac{a_{ji}}{a_{ii}}\n",
    "$$\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 31,
   "id": "4021d760-56b2-43c1-b372-2392bdbe4625",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "--- Forward Elimination -> 1 ---\n",
      "[[ 3.  2.  0. -7.]\n",
      " [ 0.  7. -1.  2.]\n",
      " [ 0.  1. 12. 61.]]\n",
      "\n",
      "--- Forward Elimination -> 2 ---\n",
      "[[ 3.          2.          0.         -7.        ]\n",
      " [ 0.          7.         -1.          2.        ]\n",
      " [ 0.          0.         12.14285714 60.71428571]]\n",
      "\n",
      "--- Upper Triangular Matrix ---\n",
      "[[ 3.          2.          0.         -7.        ]\n",
      " [ 0.          7.         -1.          2.        ]\n",
      " [ 0.          0.         12.14285714 60.71428571]]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "for i in range(m-1):\n",
    "    for j in range(i+1, m):\n",
    "        eps = Ab[j,i] / Ab[i,i]\n",
    "        Ab[j,:] = Ab[j,:] - eps * Ab[i,:]\n",
    "\n",
    "    print(f'--- Forward Elimination -> {i+1} ---')\n",
    "    print(Ab)\n",
    "    print()\n",
    "\n",
    "print('--- Upper Triangular Matrix ---')\n",
    "print(Ab)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e24b9b1d-9aca-4c5c-a4ac-4c7e2fe89bda",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Backward Substitution**\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "x_i=\n",
    "\\frac{b_i-\\sum_{j=i+1}^{n}a_{ij}x_j}{a_{ii}}\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 32,
   "id": "b423cc55-9a0a-4d9a-9267-47d1658d6c2a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Solution of x =  [-3.  1.  5.]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "x = np.zeros(m)\n",
    "\n",
    "for i in range(m-1, -1, -1):\n",
    "    x[i] = (Ab[i,-1] - np.dot(Ab[i,i+1:m], x[i+1:m])) / Ab[i,i]\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Solution of x = ', x)"
   ]
  },
